b002:l024","ordinal":352488,"en":"Hell will cover your group,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l025","ordinal":352489,"en":"If my wife comes to me,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l026","ordinal":352490,"en":"I will start a big fight."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l027","ordinal":352491,"en":"Add your giant to your population,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l028","ordinal":352492,"en":"I will completely scrap it."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l029","ordinal":352493,"en":"I am Sarybay myself,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l030","ordinal":352494,"en":"The black eye of boredom."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l031","ordinal":352495,"en":"It's a dark night,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l032","ordinal":352496,"en":"I'm one of the dark ones."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l033","ordinal":352497,"en":"As soon as you enter the circle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l034","ordinal":352498,"en":"I don't want anyone like you,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l035","ordinal":352499,"en":"I can't get enough of blood."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l036","ordinal":352500,"en":"Who cares what is covered,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l037","ordinal":352501,"en":"The best Sarybay from Kaman"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l038","ordinal":352502,"en":"Come and save your land,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l039","ordinal":352503,"en":"The summer of conflict is gentle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b002:l040","ordinal":352504,"en":"Don't slip off the stone"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b003:l001","ordinal":352505,"en":"Every time I cut it, I'll cut it."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b003:l002","ordinal":352506,"en":"Who cares what is covered,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b003:l003","ordinal":352507,"en":"I am a bird of steel."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b003:l004","ordinal":352508,"en":"If I get angry and run away,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b003:l005","ordinal":352509,"en":"I will put a cold loop."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b003:l006","ordinal":352510,"en":"Admirable Aichuruk"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b003:l007","ordinal":352511,"en":"I'll fade away"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0749:b003:l008","ordinal":352512,"en":"I will destroy your property,"}]
